{"id":"d1308b233f560aa4","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-stalk-skyscraper-adjunction.md","title":"Theorem II.6 Stalk and Skyscraper Adjunction","display":"Theorem II.6 Stalk and Skyscraper Adjunction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-stalk-skyscraper-adjunction","aliases":["14-thm-stalk-skyscraper-adjunction"],"display":"Theorem II.6 Stalk and Skyscraper Adjunction","depends_on":["[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves]]","[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]"],"source_location":"II.6 Lemma 7, printed 93; DjVu 52","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-stalk-skyscraper-adjunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-stalk-skyscraper-adjunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem II.6 Stalk and Skyscraper Adjunction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5b3dd660a5b527bb\" href=\"?note=5b3dd660a5b527bb\" title=\"14-df-skyscraper-sheaves\">14-df-skyscraper-sheaves</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.6 Lemma 7, printed 93; DjVu 52"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 为拓扑空间，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> 上的层，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>。茎、摩天楼层和自然变换集合分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5b3dd660a5b527bb\" href=\"?note=5b3dd660a5b527bb\" title=\"14-df-skyscraper-sheaves\">14-df-skyscraper-sheaves</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Nat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Nat}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"83765a3303e549f5\" href=\"?note=83765a3303e549f5\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections\">14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sky}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sky}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5b3dd660a5b527bb\" href=\"?note=5b3dd660a5b527bb\" title=\"14-df-skyscraper-sheaves\">14-df-skyscraper-sheaves</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{germ}\">\\(\\mathrm{germ}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" href=\"?note=46dda10bcd4e0ee1\" title=\"14-df-germs-and-stalks\">14-df-germs-and-stalks</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_A\\)</span> 表示集合或函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的恒等映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi:A^{F_x}\\to\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)),\\qquad\\Phi(\\varphi):=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(F,\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A),\\left(\\{(s,\\varphi(\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}s))\\mid s\\in F(U),\\ x\\in U\\}\\cup\\{(s,\\varnothing)\\mid s\\in F(U),\\ x\\notin U\\}\\right)_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi:A^{F_x}\\to\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A)),\\qquad\\Phi(\\varphi):=\\operatorname{TNat}_X\\left(F,\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A),\\left(\\{(s,\\varphi(\\mathrm{germ}_{x,U}s))\\mid s\\in F(U),\\ x\\in U\\}\\cup\\{(s,\\varnothing)\\mid s\\in F(U),\\ x\\notin U\\}\\right)_{U\\in\\tau}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi:\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A))\\to A^{F_x},\\qquad\\Psi(h)([(U,s)]_{\\sim_x})=h_U(s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi:\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A))\\to A^{F_x},\\qquad\\Psi(h)([(U,s)]_{\\sim_x})=h_U(s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\\Phi=\\mathrm{id}_{A^{F_x}},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A))}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi\\Phi=\\mathrm{id}_{A^{F_x}},\\qquad\\Phi\\Psi=\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathrm{Nat}_X(F,\\mathrm{Sky}_x(A))}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 的自然性由取茎与限制相容得到。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 对等茎代表的值相等，因为见证邻域含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，摩天楼层在这些邻域间的限制是恒等。两种构造逐代表互逆，并与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 态射、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 函数相容，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stalk}_x\\dashv\\mathrm{Sky}_x\">\\(\\mathrm{Stalk}_x\\dashv\\mathrm{Sky}_x\\)</span> 的自然伴随。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-skyscraper-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"5b3dd660a5b527bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections","status":"resolved","id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-germs-and-stalks","status":"resolved","id":"46dda10bcd4e0ee1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$F$ 为 $(X,\\tau)$ 上的层，$x\\in X$、$A\\in\\mathcal U$。茎、摩天楼层和自然变换集合分别见 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]、[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves]]、[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-skyscraper-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"5b3dd660a5b527bb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$F$ 为 $(X,\\tau)$ 上的层，$x\\in X$、$A\\in\\mathcal U$。茎、摩天楼层和自然变换集合分别见 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]]、[[14-df-skyscraper-sheaves]]、[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-